cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Return-Risk Scorer: a cost-sensitive RTO risk model for Indian cash-on-delivery orders"
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Anil
repository-code: "https://github.com/lucky07-07/rto-return-risk-scorer"
url: "https://cod-return-risk-scorer.onrender.com/"
abstract: >-
  A return-to-origin (RTO) risk scorer for Indian cash-on-delivery e-commerce
  orders. Orders are scored before dispatch and converted into an expected rupee
  loss and a three-tier recommendation, with SHAP reasons attached to every
  prediction. Trained on synthetic orders built on the real India Post pincode
  directory and calibrated against published Indian return statistics; no claim
  of validation on real merchant data is made.
keywords:
  - return-to-origin
  - cash-on-delivery
  - risk-scoring
  - cost-sensitive-learning
  - model-calibration
  - explainable-ai
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
